  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 612.06 Submittals by Non-Concurring Persons",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 612.06 Submittals by Non-Concurring Persons.\n\n(a) If the site owner is not the requestor and does not concur with the request, the site owner may submit information in writing to the department as to why the requested waiver should not be granted.\n\n(b) If there is more than one responsible party and one or more responsible parties do not concur with the request, the non-concurring responsible parties may submit information in writing to the department as to why the requested waiver should not be granted.\n\n(c) Any information submitted pursuant to (a) or (b), above, shall be filed within 20 days of the date the waiver request was filed, provided that if the 20th day falls on a Saturday, Sunday, or state legal holiday the deadline shall be the first business day thereafter.\n\nSource. #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or600.html"
